{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46862","headline":"谢道友拄杖 · 齐己","name":"谢道友拄杖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翦自南岩瀑布边，寒光七尺乳珠连。\n持来未入尘埃路，乞与应怜老病年。\n欹影夜归青石涧，卓痕秋过绿苔钱。\n他时携上嵩峰顶，把倚长松看洛川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}